cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Canadian MURB Geometry Analysis"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "MURB Geometry Research Team"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MaxPr1me/opendatabaseofbuildings-viz-for-murbs"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-27"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Python workflow to characterize representative multi-unit
  residential building (MURB) geometries across Canada using the Statistics
  Canada Open Database of Buildings, supporting building-performance simulation
  with OpenStudio and EnergyPlus.
keywords:
  - buildings
  - MURB
  - geometry
  - archetypes
  - EnergyPlus
  - OpenStudio
  - gbXML
  - Canada
  - GeoPackage
